  "prefLabel": "Gen 502.01 Ethical Standards for Genetic Counselors",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gen 502.01 Ethical Standards for Genetic Counselors. The ethical standards for genetic counselors shall be the NSGC code of ethics adopted in January of 1992 and revised April 2017, available as stated in Appendix B, with the modifications described in Gen 502.02.\n\nSource. #10666, eff 9-10-14; ss by #13502, eff 12-10-22",
